  "writing_rules": [
    "Load this template and the canon_pressures system contract before creating or structurally editing the registry.",
    "Front IDs are stable. The map key and record id must remain identical across status transitions.",
    "Never fill a null goal/current step or an empty actor, resource, opposition, source, evidence or knowledge collection by inference.",
    "Stakes are conditional possibilities, never scheduled canon outcomes or promises that they will occur.",
    "World truth, visibility classification, player knowledge and each NPC knowledge reference are separate authorities.",
    "Chronology is append-only. Existing entries may not be rewritten or deleted, and every new entry requires causal source references.",
    "An active front boundary and its temporal-frontier process must match exactly; no second clock is permitted.",
    "A reducer may change only fields supported by elapsed time, causal evidence, source owners and lawful information delivery."
  ]
